      "content": "i don't think i want to \"find small ways to care for myself.\" that sounds so pointless. it feels like i'm just trying to patch up a house that's already been burned down. everything i was is tied to him. without that, i'm just a ghost haunting my own life. i look at the empty spaces and i just think... maybe it's better if the space stays empty. maybe there was never supposed to be anything else here.",
